{"id": "12-455-2-2", "zh": "代词（sabbanāma）", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-456-2-50", "zh": "148. sabba、katara、katama、ubhaya、itara、añña、aññatara、aññatama、pubba、para、apara、dakkhiṇa、uttara、eka、ya、ta、eta、ima、amu、kiṃ、tumha、amha，这些是代词。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-457-2-4", "zh": "sabbo 的变化与 buddho 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-457-5-7", "zh": "不同之处如下。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-458-2-3", "zh": "承前“yo”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-459-2-4", "zh": "代词的 a 之后，第一格（复数 yo 变为 e）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-460-2-10", "zh": "sabba 等词的 a 之后的第一格 yo 变为 e，如 sabbe。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-461-2-18", "zh": "根据“代词之后这三者都不出现”这条禁止规则，sa、smā、smiṃ 不变为 āya、ā、e。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-461-19-20", "zh": "sabbassa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-462-2-5", "zh": "sabba 等之后，naṃ 变为 saṃ、sānaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-463-2-6", "zh": "sabba 等词之后，naṃ 变为 saṃ 和 sānaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-464-2-4", "zh": "承前“a”与“e”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-465-2-5", "zh": "代词在 naṃ 前也（变为 e）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-466-2-6", "zh": "在 naṃ 前，sabba 等词的 a 变为 e。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-466-7-10", "zh": "sabbesaṃ、sabbesānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-467-2-11", "zh": "149. 阴性加 ā，sabbā 的变化与 kaññā 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-467-12-14", "zh": "不同之处如下。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-467-15-16", "zh": "承前“vā”（可选）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-468-2-5", "zh": "gha、pa 之后，smiṃ、sa 变为 saṃ、sā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-469-2-8", "zh": "在称为 gha、pa 的 sabba 等词之后，smiṃ 与 sa 可选变为 saṃ 与 sā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-470-2-10", "zh": "根据“在单数的 saṃ、sā 前”这条规则，增加 s 音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-471-2-4", "zh": "gha 变为短音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-472-2-6", "zh": "在单数的 saṃ、sā 前，gha 变为短音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-472-7-10", "zh": "sabbassā、sabbāya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-472-11-14", "zh": "sabbāsaṃ、sabbāsānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-472-15-18", "zh": "sabbassaṃ、sabbāyaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-472-19-20", "zh": "sabbāsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-473-2-4", "zh": "在这些词之后，smiṃ 不变为 āya、yā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-474-2-9", "zh": "在称为 gha、pa 的 sabba 等词之后，smiṃ 不变为 āya、yā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-475-2-9", "zh": "150. 中性：sabbaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-475-10-11", "zh": "sabbāni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-475-12-14", "zh": "第二格也是这样。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-476-2-6", "zh": "中性的 sabba 等词，从第三格起与各自的阳性相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-476-7-11", "zh": "直到 ya 一词为止，都照此变化。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "12-477-2-19", "zh": "151. 但在 pubba、para、apara 之后，根据“规则未涵盖的形式依特例而成立”，在非阴性时 smiṃ 可选变为 e。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-477-20-23", "zh": "pubbe、pubbasmiṃ 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-478-2-4", "zh": "eka 一词有数目、相同、其他、无伴四种意思。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-478-5-13", "zh": "作数目义时只用单数，作其他意思时各种数都可以用。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-479-2-4", "zh": "ya 等词没有呼格。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-480-2-8", "zh": "152. ta 加 si。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-481-2-5", "zh": "承前“在 si 前”“sa”“非中性的”。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "12-482-2-4", "zh": "eta、ta 的 t（变为 s）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-483-2-8", "zh": "在 si 前，非中性的 eta、ta 这两个词的 t 变为 s。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-483-9-10", "zh": "so。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-484-2-6", "zh": "ta 的 t 在一切场合可选变为 n。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-485-2-9", "zh": "在三种性中，sabba 等词（这里指 ta）的 t 可选变为 n。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "12-485-10-13", "zh": "ne、te。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-485-14-19", "zh": "其余与 sabba 相同，不同的只是变为 n 这一点。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-486-2-16", "zh": "153. 阴性：sā、nā、nāyo、tā、tāyo 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-487-2-3", "zh": "承前“vā”（可选）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-488-2-5", "zh": "其后的 sa 变为 ssāya。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-489-2-7", "zh": "在 tā、etā、imā 之后，sa 可选变为 ssāya。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-490-2-4", "zh": "承前“在单数的 saṃ、sā 前”与“i”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-491-2-4", "zh": "tā 可选（变为 i）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-492-2-8", "zh": "在单数的 saṃ、sā 前，tā 一词的 ā 可选变为 i。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-492-9-16", "zh": "tissāya、tissā、tassā、tāya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-492-17-20", "zh": "tāsaṃ、tāsānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-492-21-26", "zh": "tissaṃ、tassaṃ、tāyaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-492-27-28", "zh": "tāsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-493-2-9", "zh": "154. 中性：taṃ 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-494-2-6", "zh": "155. eso。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-494-7-9", "zh": "其余与 sabba 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-495-2-8", "zh": "156. 阴性：esā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-496-2-3", "zh": "承前“在单数的 saṃ、sā 前”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-497-2-3", "zh": "etā、imā 的末音变为 i。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-498-2-6", "zh": "在单数的 saṃ、sā 前，etā、imā 的末音变为 i。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-498-7-12", "zh": "etissāya、etisā、etāya。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-498-13-16", "zh": "etāsaṃ、etāsānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-498-17-22", "zh": "etissaṃ、etassaṃ、etāyaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-498-23-24", "zh": "etāsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-498-25-27", "zh": "其余与 sabbā 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-499-2-9", "zh": "157. 中性：etaṃ 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-500-2-8", "zh": "158. ima 加 si。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-501-2-11", "zh": "根据“非中性在 si 前变为 ayaṃ”这条规则，ima 变为 ayaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-501-12-13", "zh": "si 省略。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-501-14-17", "zh": "ayaṃ、ime。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-501-18-21", "zh": "imaṃ、ime。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-502-2-15", "zh": "根据“在 nā 前变为 ana、imi”这条规则，ima 变为 ana，也变为 imi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-502-16-19", "zh": "anena、iminā。", "confidence": 90}
